# Code quality (lint & format)

## Shared config

| Tool | Package | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| ESLint | `@repo/eslint-config` | `base`, `next-js`, `react-internal`, `tailwind` |
| Prettier | `@repo/prettier-config` | single quotes, Tailwind class sort plugin |

## Commands

```bash
pnpm format          # write Prettier (+ Tailwind class sort)
pnpm format:check    # check only (turbo-cached)
pnpm lint            # ESLint in each package
pnpm verify          # format:check + lint + check-types + build
```

## Rules of thumb

- **Prettier**: formatting + Tailwind class **order** (`cn`, `clsx`, `cva`)
- **ESLint `eslint-plugin-tailwindcss`**: invalid / conflicting classes (not order)
- **import order**: `eslint-plugin-simple-import-sort` — do not hand-sort
- **a11y**: `eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y` on React/Next packages
- Do not disable lint rules without a comment and reason

## Hooks & CI

- **pre-commit**: husky + lint-staged (staged files: Prettier + ESLint fix)
- **CI**: GitHub Actions runs `pnpm verify` on PR/push to `main`

## Registry exception

`registry/design-monogatari/*` uses `@/lib/utils` for external shadcn consumers — **ESLint excluded**, **Prettier applied**. Validate with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest registry validate minoong/design-monogatari`.

